## Frequently asked questions

**How much does SEO in Swansea cost?**

Local SEO campaigns for Swansea businesses start from around **£200–£350/month**, depending on how competitive your sector is and how many areas you're targeting. [Contact us](/contact/) for a free consultation and quote.

**How long does SEO take?**

Local SEO typically shows meaningful results within 3–6 months, though many clients see improvements within the first 4–8 weeks.

**Do I need a new website first?**

Not always — we can improve SEO on your existing site. But a well-built [website](/web-design-swansea/) makes a big difference to how well SEO performs.

**Can you guarantee rankings?**

No ethical SEO agency can guarantee specific rankings. We can guarantee we'll do the right things to improve them consistently.

**What's the difference between local SEO and general SEO?**

Local SEO focuses on ranking for geographically targeted searches — "plumber in Swansea" or "builder near Sketty". It includes Google Maps / Google Business Profile alongside website rankings. Most Swansea small businesses need local SEO rather than broad, nationwide SEO.

**Do you work outside Swansea?**

Yes — we provide [SEO services across South Wales](/seo-south-wales/), including [Cardiff](/seo-cardiff/), [Newport](/seo-newport/), [Bridgend](/seo-bridgend/), and [Merthyr Tydfil](/seo-merthyr-tydfil/).

